tps://smithery.ai\"><span>smithery.ai</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link ml-0.5 inline size-[0.85em] align-[-0.05em]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>, as a public directory of MCP servers, now powered by <a data-slot=\"link\" class=\"rounded-xs font-medium underline decoration-current/35 underline-offset-4 outline-none transition-colors hover:decoration-current focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 text-brand-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.arcade.dev/?utm_source=smithery&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_content=announcement\"><span>Arcade.dev</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link ml-0.5 inline size-[0.85em] align-[-0.05em]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></li><li>A curated set of verified servers, whose registry pages will show direct MCP URLs (e.g. mcp.linear.app/mcp instead of linear.run.tools or server.smithery.ai/linear).</li></ul><h2 class=\"pt-4 font-semibold text-foreground text-lg\">What stops working on October 31</h2><ul class=\"list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\"><li>Server URLs on run.tools and server.smithery.ai</li><li>Smithery API, Connect, and Toolbox</li><li>Smithery accounts and API keys</li><li>The Smithery CLI and SDKs. We&#x27;ll mark the current versions as deprecated.</li></ul><h2 class=\"pt-4 font-semibold text-foreground text-lg\">What to do before then</h2><ul class=\"list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\"><li><strong class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Using a server yourself?</strong> Switch to the vendor&#x27;s official MCP URL. Smithery URLs stop working on October 31, and connecting through Smithery won&#x27;t be possible after that. You can find the official URL on the server&#x27;s page on <a data-slot=\"link\" class=\"rounded-xs font-medium underline decoration-current/35 underline-offset-4 outline-none transition-colors hover:decoration-current focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 text-brand-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://smithery.ai\"><span>smithery.ai</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link ml-0.5 inline size-[0.85em] align-[-0.05em]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>.</li><li><strong class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Want out-of-the-box MCPs like Gmail or Slack?</strong> <a data-slot=\"link\" class=\"rounded-xs font-medium underline decoration-current/35 underline-offset-4 outline-none transition-colors hover:decoration-current focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 text-brand-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://arcade.dev/?utm_source=smithery&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_content=announcement\"><span>That&#x27;s what we build at Arcade</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link ml-0.5 inline size-[0.85em] align-[-0.05em]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>.</li><li><strong class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Managing MCP connections for your own users?</strong> You&#x27;ll need a replacement before October 31. I&#x27;m happy to help you figure out the right one, even if it isn&#x27;t Arcade.</li></ul><h2 class=\"pt-4 font-semibold text-foreground text-lg\">If you&#x27;re on a paid plan</h2><p>We&#x27;re refunding every charge since August 5 and cancelling your subscription going forward. You won&#x27;t be charged again. Refunds usually show up within 5–10 business days.</p><p>If you want to talk through your setup or your migration, reach me at ani [at] smithery [dot] ai.</p><p>Thank you for building with Smithery. It meant a lot to us.</p><p class=\"pt-2\">Anirudh Kamath<br/>Cofounder, Smithery (now part of Arcade)</p></article><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-border/60 border-t\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-4 px-4 py-8 text-muted-foreground text-sm sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-6\"><p>Smithery is now part of<!-- --> <a data-slot=\"link\" class=\"rounded-xs font-medium underline decoration-current/35 underline-offset-4 outline-none transition-colors hover:decoration-current focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\" href=\"https://www.arcade.dev/?utm_source=smithery&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_content=footer\"><span>Arcade</span></a></p><nav class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"hover:text-foreground\" href=\"https://docs.arcade.dev/en/home?utm_source=smithery&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_content=footer\">Docs</a><a class=\"hover:text-foreground\" href=\"https://www.arcade.dev/b